---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL.replace(/\/?$/, '/');
---
<Layout title="Experience" description="Naman Patel’s experience in SEO, content, web development, and Android software.">
  <div class="inner-page">
    <header class="page-hero"><h1>Experience</h1><p>My background is in SEO and content. Today, I also build and maintain software.</p></header>
    <div class="experience-list">
      <section><h2>SEO & content</h2><p>Keyword research, search intent, on-page SEO, technical fixes, and content publishing. I use Search Console and analytics to understand what’s working and where to improve.</p><p>I worked on a content project that reached roughly one million monthly visitors at its peak, and a US entertainment project that was later acquired.</p><p class="tool-list">Search Console · WordPress · Technical SEO · Analytics</p></section>
      <section><h2>Web development</h2><p>Building responsive websites and browser tools, from the first interface through debugging, deployment, and ongoing maintenance.</p><p class="tool-list">Astro · HTML · CSS · JavaScript · Git · GitHub</p></section>
      <section><h2>Android & development workflows</h2><p>Building on-device utilities with Kotlin, testing with emulators, and preparing releases. I also use AI coding tools and supervised agent workflows as part of development.</p><p class="tool-list">Kotlin · Android Studio · Gradle · Codex · Claude</p></section>
    </div>
    <a class="text-link" href={`${base}projects/`}>View my projects <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
  </div>
</Layout>
